  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Pub. Proc. Capacity in MENA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This IDF grant was approved to move forward with a full proposal by the MENA regional IDF coordintaor (Tatyana Klimova) and the Bank IDF Secretariat.  The grant aims to begin the implementation of a regional capacity building action plan for public procurement in the MENA region which was created by the MENA Network of Public Procurement Exerts, whose membership consists largely of those responsible for public procurement in the region.#  # The bulk of the grant will fund the establishment of a sustainable capacity building program in the region on public procurement by working with instiutions and partners currently invovled in delivering procurement training to expand the scope of their materials and the number of participants trained.  In addition, a regional strategy for capacity building will also be created.</narrative>
  </description>
